sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as b9s
    participant Source as Guarded source access
    participant View as Browser or native opener
    participant Blob as Attachment backend
    participant Bd as Stock bd
    User->>App: Explicit action on Specification
    alt Open reference
        App->>Source: Check project, root containment or HTTPS scheme
        Source-->>App: Checked URL or bounded private view copy, or refusal
        alt Reference allowed and reachable
            App->>View: Open checked link or allowlisted view copy
            Note over App,Bd: No backend upload or Beads write
        else Refused or unavailable
            App-->>User: Show reason without importing
        end
    else Import snapshot
        App->>App: Require configured backend and project policy
        App->>Source: Read confined file or approved HTTPS origin under limits
        Source-->>App: Snapshot bytes or refusal
        alt Source refused, unavailable or over deadline
            App-->>User: Show failure without uploading or writing a comment
        else Snapshot obtained
            App->>App: Validate and hash bytes, recheck project and spec
            App->>Blob: Put content hash if absent
            alt Upload fails
                Blob-->>App: Failure
                App-->>User: Show failure without writing a comment
            else Blob stored
                Blob-->>App: Stored or reused
                Note over App,Blob: Crash before comment can orphan the blob until GC grace expires
                App->>Bd: Add missing reference with bd comments add
                alt Comment succeeds
                    Bd-->>App: Success
                    App-->>User: Show retained snapshot
                else Comment fails
                    Bd-->>App: Failure
                    App-->>User: Show failure, manual retry reuses hash
                    Note over Blob,Bd: Unreferenced blob waits for GC grace
                end
            end
        end
    end
